\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces Study overview and evaluation stack. A scenario bank and world context are used to generate multi-turn dialogue with 29-field social-state labels, which are validated and split into train, validation, and test sets. The same data supports four experimental tracks: from-scratch SLMs, OCEAN/VAD conditioning encoders, response-generation models, and the structured Qwen3-4B social-state pipeline. Track D is the main contribution.}}{18}{figure.caption.60}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture_stack}{{10}{18}{Study overview and evaluation stack. A scenario bank and world context are used to generate multi-turn dialogue with 29-field social-state labels, which are validated and split into train, validation, and test sets. The same data supports four experimental tracks: from-scratch SLMs, OCEAN/VAD conditioning encoders, response-generation models, and the structured Qwen3-4B social-state pipeline. Track D is the main contribution}{figure.caption.60}{}}
